Correction verified 2024-10-14","finding":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards: At the time of the inspection there were multiple hazards observed.     At the front gate of the facility, that is an entrance to the facility and a gated play area, the latch is broken. This allows the gate to open freely and leaves a risk for children to be able to leave the area.     In the older preschool play area a shed has been replaced. Along the side of the new shed there is a gap between the mulch and shed. The shed is stabilized on cinder blocks and there is a gap underneath the shed. This creates a space a child could crawl into, or an animal could easily burrow into.     At an exit gate with steps down there is cracked and jagged concrete and a gap created due to erosion of dirt. This creates a gap between the ground and the bottom of the fence and a tripping hazard for children playing.    Multiple water hoses were piled next to the building loosely.","topic":"fire","source_record_id":"1026455562","violation_type_title":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards (26 TAC §746.3701)","topic_label":"Fire safety & emergency drills"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-94239-i20240930-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2415-b","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-94239-i20240930","date":"2024-09-30","original_code":"746.2415(b)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-10-14","finding":"AP Cribs - Only Snug Fitting Sheet and Crib Mattress Cover Allowed if Infant Younger than 12 Months of Age: At the time of the inspection a child under 12 months of age was sleeping inside a crib, on their stomach, with a blanket over them. This blanket covered from the child's shoulders to their ankles. The caregiver was seated in the chair directly next to the child's crib.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026335394","violation_type_title":"AP Cribs - Only Snug Fitting Sheet and Crib Mattress Cover Allowed if Infant Younger than 12 Months of Age (26 TAC §746.2415(b))","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-94239-i20231025","date":"2023-10-25","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":2,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905740573","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905740573","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2023-10-25","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-94239-i20231025-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-745-641","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-94239-i20231025","date":"2023-10-25","original_code":"745.641","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Corrected at inspection","finding":"AP Background check results - Must receive notification prior to allowing subject to be present at your operation: The operation knowingly allowed persons to be present at the operation before receiving notification from the CBCU that the persons eligibility determination is Eligible, Provisional or Eligible with Conditions.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026440177","violation_type_title":"AP Background check results - Must receive notification prior to allowing subject to be present at your operation (26 TAC §745.641)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-94239-i20231025-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-5537-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-94239-i20231025","date":"2023-10-25","original_code":"746.5537(a)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2023-10-26","finding":"Electric or Battery-Operated Carbon Monoxide Detectors-Inspection of CO System: Carbon Detector was unavailable for review during the inspection.","topic":"fire","source_record_id":"1026279418","violation_type_title":"Electric or Battery-Operated Carbon Monoxide Detectors-Inspection of CO System (26 TAC §746.5537(a))","to